QuillCore ships two weight files taken unmodified from Universal-FrameFX:
  src/main/resources/assets/quillcore/csr/csr_ai_x2.weights.json  (CSR Flux 2x upscaler, v1)
  src/main/resources/assets/quillcore/csr/csr_ai_fg.weights.json  (CSR Frame Gen, v3)

The GLSL inference passes in assets/quillcore/csr/glsl/ and the Java reference
implementation are a new port derived from the Universal-FrameFX HLSL kernels
(CsrAi.hlsl, CsrAiFg.hlsl, and the CSRAIFG_PackA/PackB/Compose kernels).
